### Quick checklist before running

| ✅ | Item |
|---|------|
| ✅ | Have the node’s string representation ready (`currentNode`). |
| ✅ | Make sure the node actually represents a `break` statement. |
| ✅ | Verify that the new label `"loopEnd"` is what you intend. |

